cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this app, please cite the work it implements (preferred-citation), this release, and Pennsieve (RRID:SCR_021677); the other works it builds on are listed under references.
type: software
title: Pose Kinematics
abstract: Cleans pose tracks (confidence filter, gap interpolation, smoothing) and computes open-field kinematics (speed,
  heading, angular speed, body length, distance travelled, time in centre, periphery, wall zone and user ROIs) with movement,
  from ndx-pose NWB, DeepLabCut, SLEAP or Lightning Pose files; writes a behaviour NWB, a kinematics table for behavior-syllables
  and a condition comparison. Part of the Pennsieve Markerless Behaviour workflow.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
contact:
- given-names: Joost
  family-names: Wagenaar
  orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0004-5925-5451
  affiliation: University of Pennsylvania
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/pose-kinematics
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- neuroscience
- behavior
- nwb
- pose-estimation
- kinematics
- open-field
